==German==

===Alternative forms===
* [[süss]] {{qualifier|Switzerland}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|lang=goh|suozi}} (akin to Old Saxon {{term|swōti|lang=osx}}), from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*swōtuz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*sweh₂dus}}. Compare Low German {{term|sööt|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|zoet|lang=nl}}, English {{term|sweet|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|sød|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/zyːs/|lang=de}}
